NAME
    channels - list audio channels and voices

SYNOPSIS
    channels

DESCRIPTION
    Lists every audio channel or voice reported by the attached core:
    channel index, active state, envelope level (0-100), muted state, and
    core-specific voice details. Pair with mute(1) to isolate individual
    channels.

EXAMPLES
    channels

EXIT STATUS
    0   Channel list printed.
    1   No target attached or session service fault.

SEE ALSO
    mute(1), regs(1), summary(1)
